https://docs.oxide.computer/cli/system/hardware/rack/membership/abort

<div class="custom-tip">
  <span class="alert-icon"></span>
  <strong>Tip</strong><br><br>
This operation is synchronous. Upon returning from the API call, a success response indicates that the prior membership change was aborted. 
<br><br>
An error response indicates that there is no active membership change in progress (previous changes have completed) or that the current membership change could not be aborted.<br><br>
